    },
    "notes": [
      "Wood seats are procedural. Local +Z is the front (single back plank toward -Z). Students use rotationY π so that front faces the teacher. The teacher seat uses rotationY 0.",
      "Student desks, the desk lamp, and the copy stand are procedural. The catalog dining chair is a ladder back and the library lamp is a red banker's lamp.",
      "The demonstration sheet shows 永. Brushes, the inkstone, and the weight sit on the felt, clear of the character.",
      "Seat depth is 0.48 m and the seat board is at 0.44 m."
    ]
